cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the original Talk2Nature software, please cite this project and
  record the exact commit used. Cite the underlying scientific papers,
  third-party software, models and datasets separately. No archival DOI or
  scientific validation is implied by this citation.
type: software
title: "Talk2Nature: tools for observation and reproducible animal-sound research"
authors:
  - family-names: Yatom
    given-names: Raviv
repository-code: "https://github.com/Metivity/talk2nature"
url: "https://metivity.github.io/talk2nature/"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Early-stage local observation, annotation and comparison tools with
  research-metadata utilities. No general animal translator or trained
  Talk2Nature model is provided. Software was developed with substantive
  AI assistance; public documentation distinguishes software verification
  from independent scientific review. This citation covers original software;
  original summaries and third-party artifacts have separate licenses.
keywords:
  - bioacoustics
  - reproducible research
  - animal communication
  - observation
